@startuml
title Campaign State Diagram

[*] --> Assignment
state Assignment
state Approval
state ContractSigning
state Preparation
state AdvertApproval
state Scheduling
state Running
state Extension
state Completion
state Payment
state Refund
state BalanceSettlement
state Paid
state Archive

Assignment --> Approval : manager and staff assigned
Approval --> ContractSigning : everything approved
ContractSigning --> Preparation : contract signed
Preparation --> AdvertApproval : adverts prepared
AdvertApproval --> Scheduling : adverts approved
Scheduling --> Running : adverts scheduled
Running --> Extension : campaign running
Extension --> Running : extension requested
Running --> Completion : all adverts finished
Completion --> Payment : payment required
Payment --> Refund : amount paid less than required
Payment --> BalanceSettlement : amount paid more than required
BalanceSettlement --> Paid : balance settled
Paid --> Archive : campaign marked as paid
Archive --> [*] : staff and managers released
@enduml
